  "notes": "Portal behavior followed where the Rust tool diverged: curve coefficients may arrive as the chla_acid/chla_noacid standard curves (portal selection) with the request's acid_slope/acid_intercept/noacid_slope/noacid_intercept fields as fallback; a missing curve leaves that method at the portal's KEEP OLD (keys omitted) where the Rust request required all four coefficients; the per-m2 chain reads exactly sizeA/B/C, so fewer than 3 diameters omits rock_area_m2 and every per-m2 key (Rust computed the area over any dims) and extra diameters beyond 3 are ignored (Rust used all); a replicate missing fluor_before omits its chla values (Rust required fluor_before). Aggregates skip missing replicate values (calcMean/calcSd na.rm); a lone value has no sd. Replicate outputs travel as the replicates array of objects, omitted keys absent per object."
